uscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6MhK1lZ-5RDIoOusOkD_hxzCdO5PDt-VI0uZ6CME8wpg&oe=6A184063"}, {"file_name": "2024-11-12 20-40-05 - frame at 0m28s.png", "id": "607887138338570", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569440_607887141671903_7110552881332325886_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XQxcQNPy41cQ7kNvwG0EMLt&_nc_oc=AdpEhRxy8njxHwqDwG4sj0beJxbq-zX53zOy-lP77q8_2fjtwjU-n5qm1v0Gf02p4r0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4I2qNfZQHDW8pYs2yxJdcv5HbnMnyUE0uNq3dzYdp9Yw&oe=6A182FB9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "ZIX", "keywords": ["Roguelike", "Cooperative", "Roguelite", "Action", "Adventure"], "long_description": "# BECOME AN ACOLYTE OF ZIX AND SPREAD THE FLAME\n\nZIX is a VR action roguelike with a deep combat system and a player-driven procedural world generation system. Team up with friends across platforms as you remix runs and alter reality to uncover the mysteries of ZIX.\n\n{3917457575153114}\n\n# FEATURES\n\n- Play alone or with up to 2 friends \n- Allow PC players to join you as spectator Imps to cause mayhem\n- Engage in roguelike gameplay with endless combinations and replayability\n- Mix worlds together using The Cauldron and uncover their secrets\n- Express yourself with a deep, varied combat system using natural-feeling controls \n- Fight 20+ different enemies across 3 worlds\n- Find 30+ stacking upgrades that change your playstyle\n- Unlock 10+ totally new abilities to change your kit dramatically\n\n\n", "short_description": "ZIX is a VR action roguelike with a deep combat system and a player-driven procedural world generation system. Team up with friends across platforms as you remix runs and alter reality to uncover the mysteries of ZIX.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.hiddengem.io/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Hidden IO Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "